# Kite Weather
#
# A warm, faded afternoon heard through a worn cassette. No drums.
#
# Everything plays through the same tired tape: heavy wow, hiss, dulled
# highs, pads of two slightly detuned oscillators through the Juno chorus.
# The harmony is major and a little sad — Dmaj9, F#m7, Gmaj9, then the turn
# to G minor with a sixth that makes the whole thing ache — and the tune is
# simple enough to have been hummed, sitting low, sliding between notes.
#
#   bars 1-8    pad, a soft bass floor, a few distant plucks
#   bars 9-16   the tune
#   bars 17-24  the tune answers higher; the plucks fill in; the pad opens;
#               at bar 20 the tape sags and every voice sags with it
#   bars 25-28  thinning out, and the tape slows to a stop
#
# 4/4 at 88 bpm; bar n starts at beat 4*(n-1).

bpm 88
gate 0.95
tail 4

# --- the tape everything lives on
automate tape_wow
0.42 R:76 0.6:2@smooth 0.42:4@smooth R:26 0.55:4@smooth
automate tape_flutter
0.1
automate tape_age
0.5
automate tape_drive
0.35
automate chorus_mode
2
automate chorus_rate
0.5
automate chorus_depth
0.45
automate chorus_hiss
0.6
automate spring
0.05
automate reverb_wet
0.3
automate reverb_decay
0.78
automate reverb_tone
3000
automate width
1.1
automate fuzz
0

# A light parallel squeeze, the way a whole cassette dub sits together.
automate comp_in
1
automate comp_threshold
-28
automate comp_ratio
0
automate comp_attack
4
automate comp_release
4
automate comp_makeup
2
automate comp_mix
0.4

# --- pad: Kaini, two saws a few cents apart, slow in and slow out
track pad vel=0.5 patch=kaini reverb_send=0.3
([D3 F#3 A3 C#4 E4]:8 [F#3 A3 C#4 E4]:8 [G3 B3 D4 F#4 A4]:8 [G3 Bb3 D4 E4]:8)x3
[D3 F#3 A3 C#4 E4]:16

# the pad breathes in over the first eight bars and back out at the end
automate pad.gain
0.2 0.6:32@smooth R:64 0.38:16@smooth
automate pad.attack
1.4
automate pad.release
2.5
automate pad.osc2_level
0.6
automate pad.detune
11
automate pad.cutoff
600 R:64 1000:16@smooth R:16 520:16@smooth

# --- bass: Kaini, mono, a sub underneath, roots held long
track bass vel=0.55 patch=kaini gain=0.8
# the floor arrives at bar 5, once the pad has breathed in
R:16 G2:8 G2:8
(D2:8 F#2:8 G2:8 G2:8)x2
D2:16

automate bass.mono
1
automate bass.sub
0.45
automate bass.attack
0.3
automate bass.release
1.5
automate bass.cutoff
380

# --- plucks: Bocuma, a distant music box that never quite rings
track pluck vel=0.3 len=0.5 patch=bocuma pan=-0.35 reverb_send=0.4
# 1-8: a few notes on the beat
(D3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R D3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R F#3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R F#3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R F#4@0.25 R D4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R F#4@0.25 R D4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R E4@0.25 R D4 R Bb3@0.22 R G3 R E4@0.25 R D4 R Bb3@0.22 R)
# 9-16: the same, while the tune sings
(D3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R D3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R F#3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R F#3 R E4@0.25 R C#4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R F#4@0.25 R D4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R F#4@0.25 R D4 R A3@0.22 R G3 R E4@0.25 R D4 R Bb3@0.22 R G3 R E4@0.25 R D4 R Bb3@0.22 R)
# 17-24: filling in to eighths
(D3@0.34 A3 E4@0.3 F#4 C#4@0.3 A3 E4 A3 D3@0.34 A3 E4@0.3 F#4 C#4@0.3 A3 E4 A3 F#3@0.34 C#4 E4@0.3 A4 E4@0.3 C#4 A3 E4 F#3@0.34 C#4 E4@0.3 A4 E4@0.3 C#4 A3 E4 G3@0.34 D4 F#4@0.3 A4 B3@0.3 D4 A4 F#4 G3@0.34 D4 F#4@0.3 A4 B3@0.3 D4 A4 F#4 G3@0.34 D4 E4@0.3 Bb3 D4@0.3 E4 G4 D4 G3@0.34 D4 E4@0.3 Bb3 D4@0.3 E4 G4 D4)
# 25-28: a few last notes
D3@0.25 R R R E4@0.2 R R R R R C#4@0.18 R R R R R
R R A3@0.15 R R R R R R R R R R R R R

automate pluck.vel_filter
1.4

# --- the tune: Kaini B, mono, low, sliding
track tune vel=0.55 patch=kaini-b gain=1.8 reverb_send=0.22
>32
# 9-16
A4:1.5 F#4:0.5 E4:1 D4:1 E4:3 R:1
F#4:1.5 A4:0.5 E4:2 C#4:3 R:1
B3:1 D4:1 F#4:1.5 E4:0.5 D4:3 R:1
Bb3:1.5 D4:0.5 E4:2 D4:3 R:1
# 17-24: the answer, a little higher
F#4:1.5@0.6 A4:0.5@0.6 B4:1@0.65 A4:1@0.6 F#4:3@0.6 R:1
E4:1.5@0.6 F#4:0.5 A4:2@0.65 E4:3@0.6 R:1
D4:1 F#4:1 A4:1.5@0.55 G4:0.5 F#4:3@0.6 R:1
G4:1.5@0.6 Bb4:0.5@0.65 A4:2@0.65 D4:4@0.55
# 25-28
A4:2@0.45 F#4:2@0.42 E4:4@0.4 D4:8@0.38

automate tune.glide
0.11
automate tune.lfo_rate
4.6
automate tune.lfo_pitch
5

# --- the tape sags at bar 20 and every voice sags with it; at the end it
# slows to a stop. One curve, laid on each track.
automate pad.pitch_shift
0 R:76 -0.6:0.75@smooth 0:1.25@smooth R:30 -3:4@smooth
automate bass.pitch_shift
0 R:76 -0.6:0.75@smooth 0:1.25@smooth R:30 -3:4@smooth
automate pluck.pitch_shift
0 R:76 -0.6:0.75@smooth 0:1.25@smooth R:30 -3:4@smooth
automate tune.pitch_shift
0 R:76 -0.6:0.75@smooth 0:1.25@smooth R:30 -3:4@smooth
